While riding the bike, Meme-san holding me from behind: -1

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:03.960
Current adolescence point total: +1

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:06.380
Next time: The Melancholy of Thanksgiving

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:08.750
Eh? It's Meme-san's birthday?
